      "writtenOn": "2013-11-20T18:15:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just curious - how come you\u0027re using a system property rather than just a global string builder which you null out after use? (With this approach you need to keep concatenating to the same string, and since strings are immutable ever append is a full array copy.)",
      "revId": "dbc4d4e35dec59d8265e774e432802dc6363b048",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
